  "question": {
    "text": "The tangent to the parabola <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn></math> at <math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> touches the circle <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>18</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>14</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> at <math><mi>Q</mi><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;The coordinates of point <math><mi>Q</mi></math>&nbsp;are",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "X9fA6",
      "text": "<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MeZxB",
      "text": "<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mo>-</mo><mn>13</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "YtOLY",
      "text": "<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mo>-</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "oh1zj",
      "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>31</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>42</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p>",
